			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2687338">
									

<p>Not a fan of your somewhat throwaway inclusion of rape in a character's backstory. It feels like a cop-out way to add horror to a tale that didn't need it tacked on - and it was tacked on, adding nothing to the actual story of the report but being used as a touchstone for &quot;This thing was horrifying&quot;. I really do get WHY it was included, tapping into extreme personal violation, but I don't feel it earned its inclusion. Loved the story otherwise, and I'm sure you'll feel the merit of its inclusion is well worth the demerit of one reader's scorn, but that really ruined it for me. -1</p>

